    <section class="mt-5 pt-3" id="perhitungan" aria-labelledby="calculation-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">TRANSPARANSI AKADEMIK</span><h2 id="calculation-title">Dari data menjadi rekomendasi.</h2><p>Telusuri seluruh tahapan SAW. Tabel berikut menampilkan data perhitungan yang tersimpan, dengan pembulatan hanya untuk tampilan.</p></div>
    <div class="accordion" id="saw-calculations">
        <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#calc-weights" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="calc-weights">01 · Kriteria dan normalisasi bobot</button></h3><div id="calc-weights" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#saw-calculations"><div class="accordion-body"><p class="calculation-note">Bobot tersimpan dinormalisasi dengan w′ = w / Σw. Kriteria benefit mengutamakan nilai besar; cost mengutamakan nilai kecil.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Kriteria dan bobot yang digunakan pada perhitungan</caption><thead><tr><th>Kode</th><th>Kriteria</th><th>Jenis</th><th>Bobot awal</th><th>Bobot normalisasi</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<tr><td>{{ $criterion['kode_kriteria'] }}</td><td>{{ $criterion['nama_kriteria'] }}</td><td><span class="badge {{ $criterion['jenis_kriteria'] === 'benefit' ? 'text-bg-success' : 'text-bg-secondary' }}">{{ ucfirst($criterion['jenis_kriteria']) }}</span></td><td>{{ number_format($criterion['bobot'], 6, '.', '') }}</td><td>{{ number_format($criterion['normalized_weight'], 6, '.', '') }}</td></tr>@endforeach</tbody></table></div><p class="calculation-note mt-3 mb-0">Admin dapat mengubah bobot untuk perhitungan berikutnya; hasil yang tersimpan mempertahankan bobot saat dibuat.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#calc-matrix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="calc-matrix">02 · Matriks keputusan (X)</button></h3><div id="calc-matrix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#saw-calculations"><div class="accordion-body"><p class="calculation-note">Nilai mentah alternatif sebelum normalisasi. Hanya tempat aktif yang memiliki pemetaan jenjang dan mata pelajaran terpilih serta data kriteria lengkap yang dihitung. Kesesuaian mengikuti skala penilaian yang diatur admin saat perhitungan dibuat. Jarak dinyatakan dalam kilometer; nilai kriteria tambahan mengikuti satuannya masing-masing.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Matriks keputusan sebelum normalisasi</caption><thead><tr><th>Alternatif</th>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<th>{{ $criterion['kode_kriteria'] }} <span class="fw-normal">{{ $criterion['nama_kriteria'] }}</span></th>@endforeach</tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($ranking as $place)<tr><td>{{ $place['nama'] }}</td>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<td>{{ number_format($hasil['decision_matrix'][$place['id']][$criterion['kode_kriteria']] ?? $place['values'][$criterion['kode_kriteria']], 6, '.', '') }}</td>@endforeach</tr>@endforeach</tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
        <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#calc-normalized" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="calc-normalized">03 · Matriks normalisasi (R)</button></h3><div id="calc-normalized" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#saw-calculations"><div class="accordion-body"><div class="formula-box mb-3">Benefit: rᵢⱼ = xᵢⱼ / max(xⱼ)<br>Cost: rᵢⱼ = min(xⱼ) / xᵢⱼ</div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Nilai normalisasi seluruh alternatif</caption><thead><tr><th>Alternatif</th>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<th>R · {{ $criterion['kode_kriteria'] }}</th>@endforeach</tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($ranking as $place)<tr><td>{{ $place['nama'] }}</td>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<td>{{ number_format($hasil['normalized_matrix'][$place['id']][$criterion['kode_kriteria']] ?? $place['normalized'][$criterion['kode_kriteria']], 6, '.', '') }}</td>@endforeach</tr>@endforeach</tbody></table></div><p class="calculation-note mt-3 mb-0"><strong>Penanganan nol:</strong> jika semua nilai benefit 0, normalisasinya 0. Jika nilai minimum cost 0, alternatif bernilai 0 mendapat normalisasi 1 dan nilai positif mendapat 0. Jika semua nilai cost 0, semuanya mendapat 1.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#calc-preferences" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="calc-preferences">04 · Kontribusi kriteria dan nilai preferensi (V)</button></h3><div id="calc-preferences" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#saw-calculations"><div class="accordion-body"><div class="formula-box mb-3">Vᵢ = Σ(w′ⱼ × rᵢⱼ)</div><p class="calculation-note">Setiap kolom memuat kontribusi kriteria: bobot normalisasi dikalikan nilai normalisasi alternatif. Nilai V adalah jumlah kontribusi dari seluruh kriteria.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Kontribusi tiap kriteria dan jumlah preferensi</caption><thead><tr><th>Alternatif</th>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<th>w′ × R · {{ $criterion['kode_kriteria'] }}</th>@endforeach<th>Nilai V</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($ranking as $place)<tr><td>{{ $place['nama'] }}</td>@foreach($criteria as $criterion)<td>{{ number_format($place['contributions'][$criterion['kode_kriteria']], 6, '.', '') }}<small class="d-block text-muted text-nowrap">{{ number_format($criterion['normalized_weight'], 6, '.', '') }} × {{ number_format($place['normalized'][$criterion['kode_kriteria']], 6, '.', '') }}</small></td>@endforeach<td><strong>{{ number_format($place['score'], 6, '.', '') }}</strong></td></tr><tr><td colspan="{{ count($criteria) + 2 }}" class="calculation-note bg-light">V ({{ $place['nama'] }}) = @foreach($criteria as $criterion){{ number_format($place['contributions'][$criterion['kode_kriteria']], 6, '.', '') }}@if(!$loop->last) + @endif @endforeach = <strong>{{ number_format($place['score'], 6, '.', '') }}</strong></td></tr>@endforeach</tbody></table></div><p class="calculation-note mt-3 mb-0">Pembulatan tampilan hingga 6 desimal dapat menyebabkan selisih kecil saat menjumlahkan angka di tabel. Perhitungan dan pengurutan menggunakan nilai asli sebelum pembulatan.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#calc-ranking" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="calc-ranking">05 · Ranking akhir</button></h3><div id="calc-ranking" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#saw-calculations"><div class="accordion-body"><p class="calculation-note">Alternatif diurutkan berdasarkan nilai preferensi terbesar. Nilai yang sama menggunakan urutan identitas alternatif untuk hasil yang konsisten.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Ranking akhir berdasarkan nilai preferensi</caption><thead><tr><th>Ranking</th><th>Tempat belajar</th><th>Nilai SAW</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($ranking as $place)<tr><td><span class="rank-badge">#{{ $place['rank'] }}</span></td><td>{{ $place['nama'] }}</td><td>{{ number_format($place['score'], 6, '.', '') }}</td></tr>@endforeach</tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
